   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "GraphRAG \u2014 community-summary\n(auto \u00b7 drift \u00b7 global \u00b7 local \u00b7 simple)\n\u2022 community reports (findings + rating)\n  + entities + relationships + text units\n\u2022 Neptune graph traversal\n\u2022 global = map-reduce over reports\n\u2022 drift = optional HyDE primer \u2192 follow-ups",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "b_graphrag",
   "originalText": "GraphRAG \u2014 community-summary\n(auto \u00b7 drift \u00b7 global \u00b7 local \u00b7 simple)\n\u2022 community reports (findings + rating)\n  + entities + relationships + text units\n\u2022 Neptune graph traversal\n\u2022 global = map-reduce over reports\n\u2022 drift = optional HyDE primer \u2192 follow-ups",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
