   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "text": "LightRAG \u2014 dual-level keyword\n(mix \u00b7 hybrid \u00b7 naive)\n\u2022 ll keywords \u2192 entity index\n\u2022 hl keywords \u2192 relationship vector index\n\u2022 Neptune neighbor expansion\n\u2022 mix = + linked chunks (text_unit_ids)\n  + naive vector chunks",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "b_lightrag",
   "originalText": "LightRAG \u2014 dual-level keyword\n(mix \u00b7 hybrid \u00b7 naive)\n\u2022 ll keywords \u2192 entity index\n\u2022 hl keywords \u2192 relationship vector index\n\u2022 Neptune neighbor expansion\n\u2022 mix = + linked chunks (text_unit_ids)\n  + naive vector chunks",
